From d7bdc15ee45eca2eb8ec58c24617e555167e2f79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OUCO86 <ouco86@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 10:52:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Development/OptiScaler: generalise RE9 pre-SR host
 integration

Extract the host-layer integration from Development/RE9/presr/ into a
general-purpose Development/OptiScaler/ directory. Remove RE9-specific
debugging (ColourCapture, exposure capture, colour investigation) while
keeping the core host patches.

- LmxxfBackend: module path discovery, prior-job guard, Submitted()
  queue check, Retire() error handling, non-fatal geometry rebind
- LmxxfNrRuntime: struct_size check, shader path, EnqueueAfterProducer,
  codec parameters, hipQueued/outputsRecorded state tracking,
  WaitForSubmittedWork, staged kernel prep, input geometry validation
- AmdBridge: recognize LmxxfNrRuntime.dll
- ResourceStateBook: forward aliasing barriers verbatim during split
- LmxxfProductionOptions: enable byte stream / feature byte options
---
